[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_9999","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_9998","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_9997","text":"结华"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_9996","text":"理子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0010","text":"伫立在街角的咖啡店“片刻”\n新菜单的松饼似乎颇受好评……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0020","text":"不知为何，天色似乎有些不对劲──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0030","text":"啊——……失策了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0040","text":"早知道带伞来了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0050","text":"那个……不介意的话……\n用店里的伞……请……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0060","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0070","text":"谢谢您！\n不过没关系的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0080","text":"那……我再点一杯可以吗？\n说不定那时候雨就停了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0090","text":"哎呀，被淋了个正着……\n外套全湿了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0100","text":"哇……！\n我去……拿毛巾……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0110","text":"啊哈哈，我也正在躲雨呢——……\n！　……那个，前几天……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0120","text":"啊——\n是之前那位……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0130","text":"撞到的人对吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0140","text":"────……\n雨……还没停呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0150","text":"……已经打烊了吧？\n跑回去算了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0160","text":"那个！那不如一起走吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0170","text":"那个……\n还是借一下店里的伞可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0180","text":"好的，当然可以……\n我去拿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0190","text":"谢谢！\n……伞，能一起撑吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0200","text":"既然这样的话……\n那就拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_06_0011","text":"Motion"}]
